   {
    "id": "note-68",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 0,
    "y": 736,
    "text": "No WPA shown (too few games for coachless to list):\nFleet Footwork, Conqueror, Summon Aery, Deathfire Touch, Glacial\nAugment, Unsealed Spellbook, Electrocute, Dark Harvest, Hail of\nBlades, Grasp of the Undying, Aftershock, Guardian.\nPrimary tree share: Precision 84%, Sorcery 14%, Inspiration 1%.",
    "color": "#7f98ad",
    "size": 15
   },
   {
    "id": "note-69",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1500,
    "y": 144,
    "text": "How to read it",
    "color": "#b8925a",
    "size": 24
   },
   {
    "id": "note-70",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1500,
    "y": 180,
    "text": "WPA = win rate − how likely those players were to win\nanyway (after draft). Positive means the pick added\nwin chance on average.\nThe whisker is my rough 95% range from sample size\nalone. If it crosses 0, the sign is not known.",
    "color": "#e9dfc9",
    "size": 16
   },
   {
    "id": "note-71",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1500,
    "y": 340,
    "text": "What it says",
    "color": "#b8925a",
    "size": 24
   },
   {
    "id": "note-72",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1500,
    "y": 376,
    "text": "• Lethal Tempo is the default: 75% of games, +0.38\nWPA. That is inside its ±0.8 noise, so read it as\n\"fine\", not \"adds win rate\".\n• LT vs Press the Attack: 1.3 pp gap, about 1.1× its\nstandard error. A lean to LT, not proof.\n• LT vs Stormraider's: 1.9 pp, about 1.4×. The\nclearest gap here, still short of solid.\n• First Strike's +0.56 is from 283 games (±5.8). It\ntells us nothing yet.",
    "color": "#e9dfc9",
    "size": 16
   },
