   {
    "id": "note-76",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1500,
    "y": 630,
    "text": "Why it might fit Kog'Maw",
    "color": "#b8925a",
    "size": 24
   },
   {
    "id": "note-77",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1500,
    "y": 666,
    "text": "• W turns attacks into his main damage, so a keystone\nthat pays per attack over a long fight (LT) fits.\n• PTA pays once per target for 3 hits; strong in short\ntrades, weaker in long front-to-back fights.\n• Comet and Stormraider's are probably AP or poke\nsetups. Coachless doesn't split by build, so this is a\nguess.\nHypotheses from the wiki text, not something these\nstats prove.",
    "color": "#e9dfc9",
    "size": 16
   },
   {
    "id": "note-78",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 1500,
    "y": 910,
    "text": "Caveat: a keystone comes with a secondary tree and\nbuild. WPA credits the whole setup, not the rune\nalone.",
    "color": "#8f9a6e",
    "size": 15
   },
   {
    "id": "note-79",
    "type": "note",
    "x": 0,
    "y": 856,
    "text": "Stats:\nhttps://coachless.gg/runes/tree/kogmaw/precision/resolve?role=adc\n(site defaults (vs all champions)). Keystone pick counts are\nacross all secondary trees. Coachless shows no win rate or\npre-game WP on the runes page, only WPA and picks.\nRune text: https://wiki.leagueoflegends.com/en-us/<rune> ·\nicons: Riot Data Dragon 16.21.1\nMade by tools/build-kogmaw-keystones-coachless.mjs\nfrom data/kogmaw-adc-keystones-coachless.json.",
    "color": "#7f98ad",
    "size": 12
   }
  ],
